A command whose blank function holds a type error and a dead store. A blank function
shares its package's reference, and the type error skips it, so its store is not
reported.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

func _(unused int) int {
	v := 1
	v = 2
	return undefinedName
}
